ReactorV2.fill
├── caller is not the signed filler
│   └── revert before funding
├── destination is outside both factories
│   └── revert before funding
├── protocol signature or signed destination/outputs were changed
│   └── revert before funding
├── final outputs do not preserve requested token, recipient or minimum
│   └── revert before funding
├── Permit2 witness, spender, chain, deadline or nonce is invalid
│   └── revert without consuming funds or a fresh nonce
└── all authorizations are valid
    ├── destination belongs to either factory
    │   └── send the entire input to that one address
    ├── callback executes
    │   ├── already-funded destination is usable
    │   ├── nested fill reverts
    │   └── callback failure rolls back input and nonce
    └── outputs settle
        ├── exact or improved ERC20 obligations pay every recipient
        ├── native obligations pay recipients and refund surplus
        ├── native recipients and refund receivers cannot reenter settlement
        ├── later payment failure rolls back earlier payments, input and nonce
        └── consumed or directly cancelled Permit2 nonce cannot fill again

ReactorV2 deployment
├── any dependency has no code
│   └── revert deployment
└── script supplies deployed Permit2 and both factories
    └── deployed ReactorV2 fills both adapter and connector routes
